    },
    "hygieneNote": "The skills CLI drops .git, __pycache__, __pypackages__ and every metadata.json when it copies a skill, and git honours a nested .gitignore; store such files under their hygieneRenames name (check-lib's case assembly renames them back) or create them at run time.",
